{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14231740","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14231740","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1423174001:0":{"text":"얼마 전에 바꾼 망치인데, 또 좀 닳았네...","source_cn":"这把铁锤才刚换没多久，又有些磨损了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6C31D731F37ACEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423174002:1":{"text":"다 쓰고 나면 잘 닦고 평소에 오일도 좀 발라줘. 나무 손잡이도 갈라지는지 살펴보고...","source_cn":"用完要记得清洁，平时多涂一层防锈油养护，木柄也要注意开裂……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56D1C55B554C42DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423174003:1":{"text":"아! 생산 라인에 여유가 생기면 모아 강철로 망치나 하나 만들어야겠다. 분명 쓸만하겠지!","source_cn":"对了！等生产线的产能不吃紧了，用魔钢锻一把锤子吧！肯定好使！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17F84A6F9F6CB01E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:工匠莎娜":{"text":"장인 사나","source":"工匠莎娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:工匠席丽斯":{"text":"장인 시리스","source":"工匠席丽斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}